[{"title":"仆为虚谷先生作玉豹马先生有诗见酬极笔势之驰骋乃以此诗报谢","author":"龚开","text":"南山有雄豹，隐雾成变化。\n奇姿惊世人，毛物亦增价。\n天上房星浥瑞光，孕成白马而黑章。\n为谁容易来中国，风雪天山道路长。\n头为王，欲得方。\n目为相，欲得明。\n脊为将军欲得强，腹为城郭欲得张。\n绝怜此马皆具足，十五肋中包肾肠。\n嗟予老去有马癖，岂但障泥知爱惜。\n千金市骏已无人，秃笔松煤聊自得。\n君侯昔如汗血驹，名场万马曾先驱。\n山林钟鼎今何有，岁晚江湖托著书。\n白云未信仙乡远，黄发鬖鬖健有馀。\n饮酒百川犹一吸，吟诗何嫌万夫敌。\n我持此马将安归，投之君侯如献璧。\n君侯作诗凛驰骛，八荒满盈动雷雨。\n定知此马知此意，独欠老奚通马语。\n曹将军，杜工部，各有一心存万古。\n其传非画亦非诗，要在我辈之襟期，君侯君侯知不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74342,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自题山水卷","author":"龚开","text":"谷口长松涧底藤，石桥山路晚登登。\n囊琴斗酒来何暮，空负寒斋昨夜镫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74343,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高马小儿图","author":"龚开","text":"华骢料肥九分臕，童子身长五尺饶。\n青丝鞚短金勒紧，春风去去人马骁。\n莫作寻常厮养看，沙陀义儿皆好汉。\n此儿此马俱可怜，马方三齿儿未冠。\n天真烂漫好容仪，楚楚衣装无不宜。\n岂比五陵年少辈，胭脂坡下斗轻肥。\n四海风尘虽已息，人才自少当爱惜。\n如此小儿如此马，它日应须万人敌。\n老夫出无驴可骑，乃有此马骑此儿。\n呼儿回头为小驻，停鞭听我新吟诗。\n儿不回头马行疾，老夫对之空啧啧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74344,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题自写苏黄像","author":"龚开","text":"海风吹发如短蓬，精魄弄成秃鬓翁。\n归来已觉阳羡邻里喜，不似雪堂概江空。\n六年岁月幪尊中。\n何况如今一螺墨，安能及公目如初生犊。\n细观此画尤崛奇，两颧巉岩无剩肉。\n百年光景春梦婆，人閒遂少天上多。\n一炷清香留永日，柰此堂堂不语何。\n譬如宝鼎沦洄水，万夫之力那能起。\n后来博古彼谁子，犹写雄深吞簠簋。\n不然岂徒有三足两耳□□，天地中閒泣神鬼。\n□□人之龙，文之虎，人言海内四学士，又云苏门之六子。\n洪崖肩高万丈馀，谈笑拍摩何轩渠。\n当为谁作前者王，当为谁作后者卢。\n诗到圣时不读书，高处岂独煮汤坐团蒲。\n岂非迢迢百世下，好事亦写苏黄图。\n又非中郎虎贲之有身，又非叔敖身后之□死。\n典刑摩诘劣少须，一丈精神三尺素，光芒射人数百步。\n布袍便是山谷褐，可能其中有菜肚。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74345,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题昭陵什伐赤马图","author":"龚开","text":"赤骥驼僧去玉关，换他白马载经□。\n谁怜什伐飞龙子，赢得金创卧帝闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74346,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其二 智多星吴学究","author":"龚开","text":"古人用智，义国安民。\n惜哉所予，酒色粗人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74347,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其四 大刀关胜","author":"龚开","text":"大刀关胜，岂云长孙。\n云长义勇，汝其后昆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74348,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其二十三 神行太保戴宗","author":"龚开","text":"不疾而速，故神无方。\n汝行何之，敢离大行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74349,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其五 活阎罗阮小七","author":"龚开","text":"地下阎罗，追魂摄魄。\n今其活矣，名喝太伯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74350,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其六 尺八腿刘唐","author":"龚开","text":"将军下短，贵称侯王。\n汝岂非夫，腿尺八长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74351,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其十七 九文龙史进","author":"龚开","text":"龙数肖九，汝有九文。\n盍从东皇，驾五色云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74352,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其一 呼保义宋江","author":"龚开","text":"不假称王，而呼保义。\n岂若狂卓，专犯忌讳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74353,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其二十 黑旋风李逵","author":"龚开","text":"风有大小，不辨雌雄。\n山谷之中，遇尔亦凶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74354,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其二十八 一直撞董平","author":"龚开","text":"昔樊将军，鸿门直撞。\n斗酒肉肩，其言甚壮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74355,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其十四 行者武松","author":"龚开","text":"汝优婆塞，五戒在身。\n酒色财气，更要杀人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74356,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其二十九 两头蛇解珍","author":"龚开","text":"左啮右噬，其毒可畏。\n逢阴德人，杖之亦毙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74357,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其二十二 插翅虎雷横","author":"龚开","text":"飞而食肉，有此雄奇。\n生入玉关，岂伤令姿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74358,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其三十二 拚命三郎石秀","author":"龚开","text":"石秀拚命，志在金宝。\n大似河鲀，腹果一饱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74359,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其十六 混江龙李俊","author":"龚开","text":"乖龙混江，射之即济。\n武皇雄争，自惜神臂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74360,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其三十三 双尾蝎解宝","author":"龚开","text":"医师用蝎，其体贵全。\n反其常性，雷公汝嫌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74361,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其十八 小李广花荣","author":"龚开","text":"中心慕汉，夺马而归。\n汝能慕广，何忧数奇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74362,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其十五 铁鞭呼延绰","author":"龚开","text":"尉迟彦章，去来一身。\n长鞭铁铸，汝岂其人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74363,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其二十五 立地太岁阮小五","author":"龚开","text":"东家之西，即西家东。\n汝虽特立，何有吾宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74364,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其三十五 金鎗班徐宁","author":"龚开","text":"金不可辱，亦忌在秽。\n盍铸长殳，羽林是卫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74365,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其八 浪子燕青","author":"龚开","text":"平康巷陌，岂知汝名。\n大行春色，有一丈青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74366,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其三 玉麒麟卢俊义","author":"龚开","text":"白玉麒麟，见之可爱。\n风尘大行，皮毛终坏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74367,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其二十四 先锋索超","author":"龚开","text":"行军出师，其锋必先。\n汝勿锐进，天兵在前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74368,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其二十七 赛关索杨雄","author":"龚开","text":"关索之雄，超之亦贤。\n能持义勇，自命何全。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74369,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其十三 花和尚鲁智深","author":"龚开","text":"有飞飞儿，出家尤好。\n与尔同袍，佛也被恼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74370,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其三十六 扑天雕李应","author":"龚开","text":"鸷禽雄长，惟雕最狡。\n毋扑天飞，封狐在草。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74371,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其二十六 青面兽杨志","author":"龚开","text":"圣人治世，四灵在郊。\n汝兽何名，走旷劳劳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74372,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其十 浪里白跳张顺","author":"龚开","text":"雪浪如山，汝能白跳。\n愿随忠魂，来驾怒潮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74373,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其三十一 没遮拦穆横","author":"龚开","text":"出没太行，茫无畔岸。\n虽没遮拦，难离火伴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74374,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其七 没羽箭张清","author":"龚开","text":"箭以羽行，破敌无颇。\n七札难穿，如游斜何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74375,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其二十一 小旋风柴进","author":"龚开","text":"风有大小，黑恶则惧。\n一噫之微，香满太虚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74376,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其三十 美髯公朱仝","author":"龚开","text":"长髯郁然，美哉丰姿。\n忍使尺宅，而见愁眉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74377,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其十一 船火儿张横","author":"龚开","text":"大行好汉，三十有六。\n无此火儿，其数不足。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74378,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其三十四 铁天王晁盖","author":"龚开","text":"毗沙天人，證紫金躯。\n顽铁铸汝，亦出洪炉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74379,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其十二 短命二郎阮小二","author":"龚开","text":"灌口少年，短命何益。\n曷不监之，清源庙食。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74380,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其十九 霹雳火秦明","author":"龚开","text":"霹雳有火，摧山破岳。\n天心无妄，汝孽自作。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74381,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋江三十六赞 其九 病尉迟孙立","author":"龚开","text":"尉迟壮士，以病自名。\n端能去病，国功可成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74382,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柳梢青 范系尉美任","author":"龚日升","text":"二十年前。\n君家桃李，种满螺川。\n凛凛英风，真如小范，不数梅仙。\n薰风吹送朝天。\n指何物、装添去船。\n千首新诗，一轮明月，两字清廉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74383,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次林千之赠水帘洞黄秀才韵","author":"龚日章","text":"攀萝访山扉，极目穷海表。\n峰疑庐山高，岩若盘谷杳。\n药臼历穷凹，石楼迫天小。\n水帘云顶飞，丹叶天涯渺。\n古峒匝蝴蝶，闲庭喧百鸟。\n诵声杂石溜，炊烟出林杪。\n藜烛虽未辉，翠屏自环绕。\n内乐屏纷华，天机蔑胶扰。\n齑盐比膏粱，所得孰多少。\n会须携竹炉，一鸣听鸡晓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74384,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题九仙宫","author":"龚伯摴","text":"桃花流水隔人间，千古高风不可攀。\n绿树阴中孤鹤宿，碧潭深处九龙蟠。\n雨馀芝朮香丹室，夜半风云绕石坛。\n富贵由来天有命，何劳清梦到邯郸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74385,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送孟和卿平阳寻母","author":"龚孟夔","text":"杜羔念母心最苦，岂意一朝逢泽潞。\n母惊儿貌似乃翁，儿抱母啼泪如雨。\n五十孺慕朱寿昌，刺血写经毛发苍。\n间关同州晚相见，迎侍亲舆归故乡。\n人生百年一弹指，母恩未报情曷已。\n团圞尊前舞綵衣，大胜世间朱与紫。\n子行万里涉风沙，誓不见母不还家。\n儿今发落母应老，道旁看者还咨嗟。\n临川孟氏号雍睦，家世来此澶渊族。\n婆娑老慕紫荆花，料想春风依旧绿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74386,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送陈君子之四明","author":"龚宗元","text":"短亭祖帐接平川，柳拂回波系画船。\n渐向落晖分绣袖，忍听离曲怨鹍弦。\n云连稽岭应怀古，路近花源好访仙。\n那更凭高望天际，江堤烟重草绵绵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74387,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠处士林逋","author":"龚宗元","text":"高蹈遗尘蜕，含华傲素园。\n璜溪频下钓，蕙帐不惊猿。\n养浩时清啸，忘机只寓言。\n几回生蝶翅，明月在西轩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74388,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月吟","author":"龚宗元","text":"曦轮猎野枯杉松，火焚泰华云如峰。\n天地炉中赤烟起，江湖喣沫烹鱼龙。\n生狞渴兽唇焦断，峻翮无声落晴汉。\n饥民逃生不逃热，血迸背皮流若汗。\n玉宇清宫彻罗绮，渴嚼冰壶森贝齿。\n炎风隔断真珠帘，池口金龙吐寒水。\n象床珍簟凝流波，琼楼待月微酣歌。\n王孙昼夜纵娱乐，不知苦热还如何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74389,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜宴","author":"龚宗元","text":"兔魄侵阶夜三刻，蜀锦堆香花院窄。\n风动帘旌玳瑁寒，露垂虫网珍珠白。\n美人匝席罗弦管，绮幄云屏炉麝暖。\n只恐金壶漏水空，不怕鸾觞琥珀满。\n劝君莫负秉烛游，曾见古人伤昼短。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74390,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"捣砧词","author":"龚宗元","text":"星河耿耿寒烟浮，白龙衔月临霜楼。\n谁家砧弄细腰杵，一声捣破江城秋。\n双桐老翠堕金井，高低冷逐西风紧。\n静如秋籁暗穿云，天半惊鸿断斜影。\n哀音散落愁人耳，何处离情先唤起。\n长信宫中叶满阶，洞庭湖上波平水。\n万里征夫眠未成，摇风捣月何丁丁。\n楚关秦岭有归客，一枕夜长无限情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74391,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芝华亭","author":"龚明之","text":"谁道休祥系上穹，民心元自与天通。\n政平讼理为真瑞，何必金芝产梵宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74392,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"期颐堂 其一","author":"龚明之","text":"投老归来万事休，北窗一枕足清幽。\n虽然不得行胸臆，幸喜身无千岁忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74393,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"期颐堂 其三","author":"龚明之","text":"百事如今与世违，十花一木谩儿嬉。\n莫欺兀兀痴顽老，曾睹升平元祐时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74394,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"期颐堂 其四","author":"龚明之","text":"不服丹砂不茹芝，老来四体未全衰。\n有人问我期颐法，一味胸中爱坦夷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74395,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"期颐堂 其二","author":"龚明之","text":"少年已自乐杯觞，种秫安排老醉乡。\n试问几回供酒事，真成三万六千场。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74396,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"木兰陂","author":"龚茂良","text":"木兰春涨与江通，日日江潮送晓风。\n此水还应接鄞水，为谁流下海门东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74397,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"龚茂良","text":"千章古木转头空，去与人间作栋隆。\n未必真能庇寒士，不如留此贮清风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74398,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题惠来驿 其一","author":"龚茂良","text":"十里平畴际远山，土膏未动觉牛闲。\n行人多谢晴相送，只恐妨农雨大悭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74399,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题惠来驿 其二","author":"龚茂良","text":"晴云当午争挥扇，晓雾生寒又着绵。\n此是岭南春气候，日中长有四时天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74400,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"灵源庵","author":"龚茂良","text":"迟回不忍去，复作抱衾留。\n断续云间雨，萧骚木末秋。\n劳生那有此，渐老欲相投。\n最爱千山暮，钟鸣处处幽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74401,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"幽化院","author":"龚茂良","text":"昼寝招提最上头，饥禽亡赖故喧啾。\n岭云西去欲成暮，山雨北来浑似秋。\n婉娩如今真是梦，经从似旧绝堪愁。\n昔年陈迹鸡窗下，日落钟鸣山更幽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74402,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题韩干马","author":"龚复","text":"奚官小臣职奚为，马饥则秣渴饮之。\n龙媒八尺千里姿，雪花被身云陆离。\n洼之异种来天池，乘舆重惜閒驱驰。\n河清海晏无盘嬉，壮士老死不得骑。\n御柳春深白日迟，寒甃净汲冰花漪。\n目光注电吻沫脂，振迅欲掣青络丝。\n奚官小臣谨厥司，犹恐若后呵谴施。\n不必前身作马通马语，人心物性在善推。\n呜呼奚官小臣身贱卑，马不如人愚亦知。\n奈何为人牧，重爵厚禄不恤民渴饥。\n■刮膏血剔肉肌，坐令沟壑转老羸。\n今之龚黄卓鲁谁，云林丛社时所师，为出马图陈诗为。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74403,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闲咏","author":"龚炳","text":"年踰八帙雪蒙头，时对亲朋话旧游。\n万事无心闲日月，一杯有味小公侯。\n痴儿粗尔逃讥议，家训从来戒刻掊。\n世道渐艰宜勇退，为吾及早理松楸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74404,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"学诗 其二","author":"龚相","text":"学诗浑似学参禅，语可安排意莫传。\n会意即超声律界，不须鍊石补青天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74405,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"学诗 其一","author":"龚相","text":"学诗浑似学参禅，悟了方知岁是年。\n点铁成金犹是妄，高山流水自依然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74406,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"学诗 其三","author":"龚相","text":"学诗浑似学参禅，几许搜肠觅句联。\n欲识少陵奇绝处，初无言句与人传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74407,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"濡须坞","author":"龚相","text":"南北安危限两关，迅流一去几时还。\n凄凉千古干戈地，春水方生鸥自閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74408,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"龚相","text":"夜半微雨湿，凌晨春草长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74409,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题天庆观碧玉堂","author":"龚准","text":"清晓叩玄关，忧时鬓已斑。\n何如闲道士，隔竹看君山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":74410,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]